  "description_for_human": "Create engaging educational games with AI. Choose any subject, set difficulty and age range, pick game mechanics, and generate complete playable learning games instantly. Free, no signup required.",
  "description_for_model": "Game Creator Learn is a free, browser-based AI tool that generates complete playable educational HTML5 games. Users configure learning parameters (subject, topic, difficulty, age range, game type, mechanics, visuals, audio) through a sidebar interface, and the app assembles a detailed prompt sent to a user-chosen LLM provider to produce a single-file HTML game. Supports 12 subjects, 12 game types, 15+ mechanics, 6 age ranges, 6 LLM providers (OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, Ollama, LM Studio, Custom). All generation happens client-side — no backend, no signup, BYOK API keys.",
